(NULL, 'mc', 'Who wrote the dystopian novel "1984"?', 'pop_culture', '11_12', 'easy', true, '[{"label":"Aldous Huxley","isCorrect":false},{"label":"Ray Bradbury","isCorrect":false},{"label":"George Orwell","isCorrect":true},{"label":"H.G. Wells","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'George Orwell wrote "1984" in 1949. It depicts a totalitarian society ruled by "Big Brother" and introduced terms like "doublethink" and "Newspeak."'),
