-- age_band: 11_12 | difficulty: medium
(NULL, 'mc', 'In "Lord of the Flies," why do the boys end up on the island?', 'pop_culture', '11_12', 'medium', true, '[{"label":"They were on a school camping trip","isCorrect":false},{"label":"Their plane was shot down during wartime","isCorrect":true},{"label":"They were shipwrecked at sea","isCorrect":false},{"label":"They ran away from home together","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'In William Golding''s "Lord of the Flies," a group of British boys are stranded on an island after their evacuation plane is shot down during a wartime conflict.'),
